            ]}
        />
        <Box style={{ height: 22 }} />
        <Box style={{ height: 68, background: '#E8EFF8', paddingLeft: 24, paddingRight: 24, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, lineHeight: 1.6, color: '#1A2230' }}>切块策略应当<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>由本书的实测结构推导</span>，而不是套用现成模板——四处不一致，任何一处沿用通用做法都会切出脏数据。</Text>
